67484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/777aa2682bf7e96478e88c29241394bc.avif?t=1785067484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras_big/777aa2682bf7e96478e88c29241394bc.webp?t=1785067484 width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/4a1fe0d99a1959212f8e9083a4c038de.avif?t=1785067484\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIQUE TILE-BASED BUILDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend a custom base using a flexible tile system not seen in any other game. Switch to a top-down construction view to place walls, rooms, and fortifications, then upgrade every element using materials you find or craft.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL RESOURCE AUTOMATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create massive automated production lines capable of crafting weapons, materials, supplies, and equipment. Establish factories, fortify outposts, and develop complex resource systems that run while you focus on exploration or combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REALISTIC COMBAT SIMULATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is grounded, physical, and skill-based. Use advanced weapon modification, slow and fast reloads, leaning, realistic ballistic penetration, and armor simulation. Survive encounters using tactics rather than pure stats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEEP SURVIVAL SYSTEMS &amp; MECHANOID THREAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world pushes back with deep survival mechanics, including hunger, sickness, injuries, temperature, farming, cooking, and medical treatment. When night falls, mechanoids emerge and roam the world, hunting relentlessly even when you are playing solo. Their presence ensures that the world remains dangerous, reactive, and unpredictable at all times. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/6d908a03f4d07b37711b99c31a8a1cf4.poster.avif?t=1785067484\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/6d908a03f4d07b37711b99c31a8a1cf4.webm?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/6d908a03f4d07b37711b99c31a8a1cf4.mp4?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/777aa2682bf7e96478e88c29241394bc.avif?t=1785067484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras_big/777aa2682bf7e96478e88c29241394bc.webp?t=1785067484 width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/0837d93979d854327c226a9fb2b1486b.avif?t=1785067484\" width=1560 height=196 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SKILLS, QUESTS &amp; TRADING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, trade valuable items, and upgrade your character through a dynamic item-driven economy. Follow storyline missions, meet in-game characters, earn experience, and unlock new skills and unique rewards that shape your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC WORLD EVENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to helicopter crash sites, airdrops, global PvP encounters, and other emergent scenarios that create constant risk and reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VEHICLES WITH TRUE-TO-LIFE HANDLING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair and operate vehicles like cars and helicopters, each with realistic handling and manual gear systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/15f3b5610c83b790ecb2c3f520884a6f.poster.avif?t=1785067484\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/15f3b5610c83b790ecb2c3f520884a6f.webm?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/15f3b5610c83b790ecb2c3f520884a6f.mp4?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > If you’re looking for an open-world survival game with infinite replayability, deep systems, realistic combat, player-driven worlds, and full control over how you want to play, <strong><i>ORMOD: Directive</i></strong> delivers a complete survival sandbox built for creativity, challenge, and emergent gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/6f3186c9eed1b7cd642d12a7e47fd1da.avif?t=1785067484\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras_big/6f3186c9eed1b7cd642d12a7e47fd1da.webp?t=1785067484 width=1560 height=67 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/2879bf780e0ce5aced849d6476f310c1.poster.avif?t=1785067484\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/2879bf780e0ce5aced849d6476f310c1.webm?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/extras/2879bf780e0ce5aced849d6476f310c1.mp4?t=1785067484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Shape your own survival experience in an infinite open-world sandbox. Customize world difficulty, rules, and playstyle. Play solo, co-op, or on 24/7 MMO-style servers across PvP, PvE, Hardcore, or Creative modes as you build, automate, fight, and survive. The choice is yours.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Romanian, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/53e7a3f14b3c3ece452a3ca63829994e0f1ed5cf/header.jpg?t=1785067484", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/374d0801d4680839f2eaec88d187c6f74db14654/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785067484", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424730/374d0801d4680839f2eaec88d187c6f74db14654/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785067484", "website": "https://ormoddirective.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / AMD RX 560 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB av